# Frontend (Vite) — copy to `.env` in this folder before `npm run build`.
#
# If the live site returns 404 for /api/health, the static host is not proxying to Node.
# Set VITE_API_URL to the **public origin where Express listens** (no path, no trailing /api):
#   • Node on a Hostinger subdomain: VITE_API_URL=https://your-app.hostingersite.com
#   • Same hostname + nginx proxies /api → port 3001: VITE_API_URL=https://vebxrun.com
#
# After `npm run build`, scripts/sync-api-config.mjs also writes dist/api-config.json
# with this value so the admin dashboard and /api/* fetch calls hit the right host.
#
# VITE_API_URL=https://vebxrun.com
